    "body": "Fixes #8660.\n\nThis patch correctly stores the gradient norm calculated during \\clip_fp32_gradients()\\ to \\self._global_grad_norm\\ when using ZeRO stage 0.\n\nAlso resets \\self._global_grad_norm\\ to \\None\\ at the beginning of \\_take_model_step()\\ and documents that the function returns \\None\\ when Stage 0 gradient clipping is disabled.",
